Follow this repository's instructions and the linked loop setup guide. Check
the prerequisites and safeguards, and surface any human decisions or blockers.
```

The [agent-loop setup guide](docs/how-to/setup-serial-gitlab-agent-loop.md) is
the detailed procedure and source of truth for installation and operation. See
the [agent-loop reference](docs/reference/serial-gitlab-agent-loop.md) for the
operational model.

